# Firebase ADMIN service-account key — SERVER ONLY, never commit. This is the
# private key that can send push as us; it lives on the server root-only.
# (google-services.json is the PUBLIC client config and IS committed — do not
# add it here.)
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
fcm-service-account*.json
secrets/

